Machteld overlay for Tcl 9.0.4. The Tcl license applies to these modifications.
Reuse an exclusively owned Tcl collection for an immediately following local assignment after evaluating the functional operands in order.

Keep either already evaluated element of a two-element list selected by an adjacent immediate index.

